' ============================================================ pattern notes



note as dependencyRule
  <b>Module rule</b>: feature packages (donation, volunteer, event,
  beneficiary, communication) depend only on <b>core</b>,
  never on each other. Only <b>app</b> (DataStore, NonProfitFacade,
  MainMenuController) and App know all of them.
end note













@enduml
